00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:31.860
The truth is we thought it would be neat if
people could ride a radio-controlled vehicle.

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.570
Talk about simple!

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:42.540
It's so simple it's ridiculous!

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:45.250
Ah, I can't breathe!

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.680
And is it no good because it's simple?

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:50.210
What's wrong with it being simple?

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:52.890
It seems like fun.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:57.320
Isn't that more than enough reason
to start a project?

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:03.790
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to make fun of it.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:08.570
You see... Once upon a time,
there was a guy standing right here,

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.570
