00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:12.800
Uh, what about us?

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:13.400
Uh, what about us?
Um...

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:13.730
Um...

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:17.900
What? Doesn't that work for you?

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:21.340
It's not that... Uh, who ARE you anyway?

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:25.150
Ah, that's right! I never introduced myself.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:29.110
I am Chihiro Fujimi, Ex-Club Manager.

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.010
Nice to meet ya!

