And first in the 6-hour endurance race?!

00:06:57.510 --> 00:07:00.710
Is that where Tamiya and Otaki came in?

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.220
I get it.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:05.740
That kind of rigorous racing environment
is what made them who they are now.

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:10.480
What?! She came in 3rd (amateur class)
In the Suzuka 8 Hours?! What is this?!

00:07:11.190 --> 00:07:14.220
She participated in the Paris-Dakar Rally
(as an amateur)?! What the hell?!

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:18.370
Senior! There are pictures of her
racing in the Sahara in here!

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:21.770
So basically she was an
amazing person, right?

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:23.570
It sure looks like it!

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:26.340
Plus, it looks like she was employed
in the motorsports division

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.310
of a motorcycle manufacturer
after she graduated.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:32.200
Senior, do we even stand a chance
against such an amazing person?

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.320
I don't know.

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:38.020
Ms. Fujimi said she wants to race with us...

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.650
but it's not like I know anything about her...

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:43.650
Don't you want to race?

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:49.800
Well, the thing is, that's not what
I built this bike for...

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:53.730
Encounters like this are never
by coincidence.

00:07:55.900 --> 00:08:00.970
I'm sure there must be some sort of reason
why the two of you met today.

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:03.780
I wonder...

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:05.010
Ooh!

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:07.150
Check out this old photo!

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:10.280
Tamiya and Otaki look so YOUNG!

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:15.490
I'll bet this picture is from when their
group was raised to club status.

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.490
That smile...

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:20.460
She really must have been happy.

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:23.490
Oh! Now that takes me back.

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:26.260
You were still here?!

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.440
Sorry to ask, but could you lend me
that box end wrench?

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.510
Uh, yeah, sure...

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:32.400
Thanks!

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.140
What are you going to use it for?

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:38.270
Well, I couldn't just leave my
baby there like that...

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:42.020
She's fixing it?!

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.920
Doh! This part's broken, too!

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:44.550
How the heck did she lower the engine?!

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:46.390
There's no brake fluid!
How the heck did she lower the engine?!

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:46.550
